     "textwithimage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/terasic/images/Terasic Apollo S10 SOM%0A2.jpeg",
      "imageRatio": "30",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "Terasic Apollo 10 Developer Kit",
      "text": "<ul>\r\n<li>The Kit is composed by<ul>\r\n<li>Apollo S10 Module (heatsink installed)</li>\r\n<li>Apollo Carrier Board</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Apollo Carrier Board features include:<ul>\r\n<li>PCIe Gen3 x4 via Thunderbolt 3 (Type-C Connector)</li>\r\n<li>USB Downstream port via Thunderbolt 3 (Type-A Connector)</li>\r\n<li>Two QSFP connectors (40G Ethernet)</li>\r\n<li>Clock Generator to provide reference clock for transceiver IP</li>\r\n<li>LED x4, Button x2, Switch x2</li>\r\n<li>2x20 GPIO Expansion Header. Adjustable IO Standard 3.3V/2.5V/1.8V.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
